    packaging: make libc++ provenance topology-independent
    
    Record stable source and release content anchors instead of branch-specific patch topology. The exact package revision remains available in the VCS field generated by GBS.
    
    This is a packaging metadata-only correction; runtime sources and build configuration are unchanged.
    
